<title>JAPAN: Sanden files 20 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Sanden files 20 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanden Corp filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry last week to issue up to 20 billion yen of corporate bonds, effective from August 20, the ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sanden makes car air conditioners.</p>
<p>- Tokyo equities desk (813) 3432-9404</p>
<p>email: tokyo.equities.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
